/**
 * Race-safe single-statement writes (Quickback plan 031-F).
 *
 * `guardInsert(builder, condition)` turns `INSERT … VALUES (…)` into
 * `INSERT … SELECT … WHERE <condition>`: the row is written only if the
 * condition holds at the moment the statement runs, so "check, then write"
 * can't race. The row itself is still built by the normal insert pipeline
 * (scope stamps, audit stamps, firewall-on-write, trigger hooks, encryption);
 * only the VALUES list is swapped for a guarded SELECT.
 *
 * Generated by Quickback Compiler.
 */
